WEBVTT

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.790
Good morning, Jululu.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.660
Huh? Jululu?

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:18.030
Oh, I get it. Playing hide and seek, are we?

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.080
Capisce!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.290
Found you!

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.660
Capisce!

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.620
That's weird...

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.790
The Rosette's not here, either.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.590
Could she be in the living room?

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.310
Onee-sama...

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.100
I must seize...

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.310
Are you maybe hiding in these clams?

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.950
Come out, come out, wherever you are.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.910
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:48.610
Breaking PriPara news!

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.860
The goddess Jewlie has appeared again!

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.370
Jululu?

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.580
Jewlie's appeared again?

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.540
Where's Jululu... where's Jewlie?

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:04.740
Lala!

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:06.780
She's moving apace.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.710
She only resurrected five minutes ago!

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:11.410
It feels different than usual-garu.

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:11.920
Huh?

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.640
Jewlie-sama, you're so beautiful!

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:18.340
Jewlie-sama, you're radiant!

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:22.310
Thank you, everyone!

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:23.690
Here she is-pri.

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:24.770
She's doing a show?

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:28.230
I have something important to tell you all today!

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:29.190
Huh?

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:30.330
What's that?

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.690
What is it?
Something important?

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:37.110
Until quite recently, I was in the form of a baby.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.400
Little Jululu?

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.970
PriParis Meganii-san's kid?

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.160
But now the time has come.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:48.540
I shall not return to being a baby again.

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:49.680
What?

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:53.050
From now, I will devote myself
entirely to the duties of a goddess.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.790
All idols are radiant!

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:00.760
You too! And you! Let's shine together!

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:23.260
Making Drama, switch on!

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:29.240
Sha-la-la!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.600
Sha-la-la-la-lan!

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:40.380
A concerto...

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:46.870
from beyond the stars!

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:50.610
Divine Cyalume Change!

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.050
Jewlie-sama, you're so divine!

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.050
Jewlie-sama, you're my goddess!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.010
I love you, Jewlie!

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.970
The time has finally come, hasn't it?

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.890
Congratulations, goddess Jewlie, on your complete resurrection.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.530
Why, thank you.

00:04:54.470 --> 00:05:00.360
And I wish to express my gratitude as well to the one who took me in and raised me!

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:01.640
Huh?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.820
What?

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:05.890
Does she mean Lala-chan?

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:07.280
Lala-chan?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.280
The goddess is thanking Lala-chan?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.990
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.000
What do you mean?

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.410
We've been caught unawares!
I can't absorb these new details!

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:18.170
Onee-sama.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.970
It's another goddess!

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.050
The one from before?

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:25.800
Janice!

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:29.240
A complete resurrection: how absurd!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:33.720
Today you lose the title of goddess!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.850
Janice...

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.140
Be it willingly or by force, I <i>will</i> take the baton!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.190
Halt, Janice!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.300
Janice! No, Janice, you mustn't!

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:42.720
Give me the baton!

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.490
It's sending you information!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:10.990
Abdication...

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:15.100
And Onee-sama... ceasing to exist?

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:16.520
What?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.600
What's happening?

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.100
What's happened?

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.980
Wh–What in heavens was that?

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.320
So you saw it.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:29.740
When a goddess touches the baton, it becomes a conduit for information.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:34.400
I'll explain everything to all of you.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.460
This is my younger sister, Janice.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:38.800
Younger sister?

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:43.700
Actually, after this Divine Idol Grand Prix final's conclusion,

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:47.920
I was to abdicate as goddess due to the system.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.510
Abdicate?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:53.930
It means Jewlie will leave the throne of goddess and change places with someone else.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:56.640
And my replacement...

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:59.020
is to be you, Janice.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.310
But my role is that of an assistant!

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:07.030
I'm sorry for keeping quiet.
I'd resolved to not breathe a word of it.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:08.250
But...

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:11.570
I had concern for you.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.650
And of giving the baton to you and leaving the idols in your care.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:21.280
After all, you've always valued
rules and order above everything else.

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:25.460
<i>Onee-sama, that girl is lazing about.</i>

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.800
<i>Her idol rank should be lowered.</i>

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.060
<i>But perhaps there's a reason for it.</i>

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:33.550
<i>And that girl is not contributing to her team at all.</i>

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:34.970
<i>And </i>that<i> girl is...</i>

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:39.480
Of course, protecting the order of things is important.

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:43.190
You're not wrong at all, but...

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:50.030
Before I abdicated, I wanted you to observe idols up close.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:51.990
So back then...

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:56.080
Preparing a PriTicket for me, too, was part of this plan?

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.790
It was all programmed into your PriTicket.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:03.530
The first time I resurrected was after the third Grand Prix.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.540
Next was on the cusp of the fourth.

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:08.790
And today is my full resurrection.

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:11.260
I've arrived here exactly as I intended to.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:15.340
And it was all for my sake?

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:19.060
Janice, how did you find descending to the surface?

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:22.060
What did you feel, meeting idols in person?

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.140
I...

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:28.100
despised it, at first.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:28.110
I believed a goddess should view all equally.
despised it, at first.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:31.030
I believed a goddess should view all equally.

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:34.990
I endeavoured to keep my distance as much as possible.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:36.920
And yet...

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:40.660
At some point whilst mingling with them...

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:46.160
All their worries, and efforts, everything that mattered to them...

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:47.690
I saw as radiant.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.050
Even if it was incomplete...

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:53.590
it was all precious.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:57.600
Janice...

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:01.600
Hearing you say that truly makes me happy.

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:05.900
Now my worries are taken care of;
I can leave PriPara in your hands.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:11.780
But even with a reason, to descend before everyone...

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:16.320
goes against the system's fundamental principals, and the rules governing even a goddess.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.910
Does that not carry an inherent risk?

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.660
It certainly does.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:25.830
Goddess though I may be,
such an action is unsanctionable.

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.790
Along with abdicating...

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.840
I will cease to exist.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:32.250
Ucha!

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.630
She'll what?

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.140
She will disappear.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:47.100
Even a slight disturbance in PriPara's system will have grave ramifications.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:53.360
This was what I  feared, and strove to avoid most,
and with every effort I tried to stop her...

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:57.820
But I didn't imagine Onee-sama could cease to exist!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:00.490
Was this what you sought, Onee-sama?

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.640
To shoulder everything yourself?

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.160
What?

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.670
No way...

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:15.030
And it's all my fault!

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:21.310
Janice, you haven't done anything wrong.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:24.520
Moreover, it was for my sake as well.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.680
I'm sure you remember.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:31.270
"I want to be an idol.
I want to be friends with the idols."

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:35.840
That's been my dream for so long now.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:41.800
I'd always regretted being unable to know idols' true feelings.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:46.790
That's why I wanted to experience
that dream before it all ended, no matter what.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:50.060
Even if it meant I would disappear.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:57.920
And thanks to that, I was able
to observe idols from up close!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:01.800
Their hopes, dreams, joys, hindrances and setbacks.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:05.990
I grew to love everyone all the more,

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:10.150
and I feel I've become something even more than a goddess.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.230
I don't have a single regret.

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:14.900
Onee-sama!

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.910
I do apologise for causing a fuss.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:25.580
The Divine Idol Grand Prix system
will proceed as normal, so please rest easy.

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:30.080
Now the two of us will return to the atrium stage.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.430
Come, Janice.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.340
What? Why?

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:38.550
We'll let you know the schedule going forward shortly.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.630
Wait! Don't go!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:41.950
My goddess!

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:43.100
What's going on?

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:45.760
Jululu! Jululu!

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:48.220
Farewell.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.590
She vanished.

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.080
I can't believe a goddess could just disappear...

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:04.810
Jewlie...

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:05.320
We love you...

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.080
What's going to happen with
the Divine Idol Grand Prix?

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:12.420
What's going on? I don't get it!
I don't understand anything!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:16.420
Everything's so sudden I can't capisce at all!

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.290
Lala.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:19.260
I know how you feel.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.380
She's gonna disappear?

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:24.760
I changed her nappies-usa...

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:27.100
We played together-kuma...

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:33.230
Even if she chose this,
I can't just stand by and watch-pri!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:33.770
Aye.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:35.870
I understand it-chanko.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:38.730
But you're right: that doesn't mean we have to accept it.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.620
I won't let her disappear.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:45.660
Three's no way I can let Jululu disappear!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:50.370
I mean, come on! A mum's job is to take care of her kid!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:53.620
So I'm helping Jululu! I won't let her disappear!

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:58.380
Me too. I want to help Jululu.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:12:59.810
Me too!

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:00.430
Yeah!

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:01.220
Garuru too!

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:02.530
Phoenix not going anywhere!

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:03.100
Yes!

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:05.630
Our hearts and minds united: we're unanimous.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:08.610
I'm sure there's a way to help her-pri.

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.100
Although...

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:13.550
At least, I have to see her...

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:14.770
one more time!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:18.180
If we could but go to the atrium stage.

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:22.560
That's im-pri-ssible. Only Jewlie can make the goddess system work-pri .

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.460
I wouldn't give up hope just yet.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.610
Hibiki-san!

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:32.910
A genius can make the impossible possible.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:39.670
Onee-sama! I had no right to the baton after all!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:48.200
If I were to take the throne of goddess,
PriPara would become a façade, a pale imitation.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:52.430
You saw the smiles leave their faces, did you not?

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:56.400
I've learned what's more important than rules.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:59.310
But for <i>this</i> to be the price!

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:03.440
I'm glad.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:08.990
I think I'd hate more than anything to disappear while quarrelling with my beloved sister.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:11.160
Onee-sama...

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:16.910
I will support you with all my strength
and see this Grand Prix through to its success.

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:19.850
Thank you, Janice.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:26.010
Wait, you don't mean to hack the goddess system-pri?

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:29.050
No, not even I could accomplish such a thing.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:34.350
However, the primitive, simian PriPara system controlling the elevator is full of holes: another matter entirely.

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:37.760
It opened!

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:38.770
Well done!

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:42.310
No, I've not done anything yet.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:43.620
It opened of its own accord.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.330
Geru?

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.530
Do you think Jululu...?

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.870
L–Let's get in quickly!

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:48.700
Please wait a moment.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.240
Huh?

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:53.240
Miss Hibiki, I must apologise
for our "primitive, simian system".

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:56.540
But holes though there may be, we'll see, hear and speak no evil.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.750
And we shall accompany you as well.

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:02.270
We will, too.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.460
I'll call happiness forth for the goddess-tori!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:08.130
Wait for Miró!

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:20.490
So heavy...

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:21.900
We've been expecting you.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:22.560
Huh?

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.480
It's Jewlie!
Jewlie!

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.480
Jululu!

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:29.740
Welcome, everyone, to the goddesses' abode.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.950
I'm so pleased all the finalists have come to visit.

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:35.160
Welcome, glad to be here!
Hope I haven't terracotta cold!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.360
I'd hate-rracotta cold, so let's trample on in quick!

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.460
It's time to get...

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.220
... The King Geumgang together.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:45.590
Ajimi, there's something I'd like to ask of you.

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.050
Geum-go ahead.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.470
Wow.

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:50.370
She truly is a goddess.

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:52.760
To think there was such a method to handling her.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.180
It's tera-cosmically enormous!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:03.900
What I wanted to ask of you, Ajimi...

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:13.820
was to paint a picture on this bare white wall.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.870
I'm Cézanne my chance – let's Gauguin!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:19.200
Good, good, Gutenberg-Da Vinci!

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:22.660
<i>Thank goodness. Now we can talk properly.</i>

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.340
Janice...

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:31.400
We want to help Jewlie-pri!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:32.240
Help me?

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:36.140
Of course! There must be a resolution where you do not disappear!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.140
We'll do whatever it takes!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:40.780
I won't eat Red Flash anymore!

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:43.980
I'll apologise to everyone I've annoyed...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.450
I'll c–c–cease tricking people!

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:48.860
I won't say "capisce" anymore!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:49.980
Hold on a minute, everyone.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.530
This is serious.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:56.450
Don't say that. To think you'd give up such precious things...

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.930
It makes me very happy!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:02.500
But the goddess system cannot be denied.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:04.770
No matter what?

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:05.630
No matter what.

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:06.730
It's impossible?

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:07.460
It is.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:10.170
Garuru will do this then-garu!

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:13.230
This way you can't ever disappear-garu!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.430
Oh, Garuru.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.720
You've really tried hard, haven't you?

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:29.900
Yep!
Indeed.

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:32.240
Garmageddon.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:36.320
You're all this goddess's pride and joy.

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:38.720
Garu!
Okay!

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.200
I'm the defective little goddess.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.980
<i>You defective little goddess!</i>

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:48.200
O–Oh, no...

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:52.210
I deeply regret my discourtesies towards you.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.800
Oh, don't worry about it.
I have much to apologise for as well.

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:59.720
Hibiki-chan, you're the most splendid as you are now.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:00.440
Hibiki-chan

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:02.440
Thank you kindly.
Hibiki-chan

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:06.560
I've always aspired towards the PriPara you've united.
Hibiki-chan

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.590
Fuwari, you've had many struggles, haven't you?

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:11.770
I have.

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:16.320
Keep being the strong foundation that Tricolore needs.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:18.240
I will, my goddess.

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:24.240
Falulu, congratulations on awakening from a mere PriPara doll to a true idol.

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:26.130
My life is happy.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:30.130
Cosmo, Chanko, Ajimi.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:32.840
Being with you is the most fun!

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:34.840
I'm cosmically honoured.

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.010
We can keep going-chanko!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.180
Daddy.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.680
Return to the battlefield!

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:50.600
Return to the Battlefield

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:53.860
The goddess's call is

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.030
Thank you for keeping it safe.

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.850
Now it's my turn to get praised, right?

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.490
C'mon, gimme all you've got!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:04.240
You cherish your brother and your friends and you don't stand for injustice,

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:07.410
and associating with an intellectual equal
as a baby was most enjoyable!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.620
Wait, was that supposed to be a compliment?

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.210
Reona.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:17.170
Having someone to protect throughout your whole life will be a blessing.

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:18.730
Me too!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.020
I'm sorry.

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:31.270
I was so unreasonable towards all of you.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.230
It's fine.

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:36.820
Thank you for teaching me such valuable things.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:38.820
I'm truly grateful.

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:40.370
It's fine.

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:45.750
It's thanks to you all that I've grown into my role as the next goddess.

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:48.500
The next PriPara will be in good hands.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.860
We'll meet again!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:56.830
And this time I'll be a true,
caring companion! Licky-stick!

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:57.940
Janice!

00:19:57.940 --> 00:19:59.420
Oh, Janice!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:00.770
Pushu...

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:03.790
And Sophie, your stamina appears to have run dry.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:09.030
Make sure you don't let your dormant genius fade away, too.

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:13.770
Mirei.

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:15.850
Don't look so down.

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:19.740
You'll never say you're quitting PriPara again, will you?

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:23.470
If I did, I'd pri-clare myself guilty!

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:37.420
Everyone... I may be a goddess,

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:42.200
but for one moment,
I'd like you to put that aside.

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.890
Jululu! Your mama's not going to give up!

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:56.170
I swear it! I swear I'll save you!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:57.070
Mama...

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.480
There's something I want...

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.170
even more than that!

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.550
And this is for you, Mama.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.420
Jululu...

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:16.960
Now then, it's time we part.

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:19.700
All you finalists,

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:23.340
Let's make this the greatest tournament ever.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:25.010
I'll be praying for your good fortune.

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:41.150
We... didn't find a way to save Jewlie after all.

00:21:41.490 --> 00:21:43.750
But I know there is one!

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:46.610
There's still time until the Divine Idol is chosen!

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:49.950
That's it!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:53.040
A Divine Idol may be able to create a miracle!

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:55.790
After all, the goddess Jewlie was the one who said...

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:59.240
a Divine Idol's purpose is to make PriPara sparkle!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.210
Then if I become a Divine Idol...

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:05.440
It's not impossible.

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:06.900
It's in no way assured.

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:08.800
But there's no other way.

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.370
Going to try!

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:10.930
Yes!

00:22:12.980 --> 00:22:15.370
Aim to be a Divine Idol!

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:54.620
The curtain opens at last
on the Divine Idol Grand Prix final!

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:59.460
In the final round, the six teams who won their way here will compete in a tournament!

00:23:59.460 --> 00:24:02.190
Match-ups both advantageous and unexpected.

00:24:02.190 --> 00:24:05.710
Teams you desire battle with
and teams you do not want to concede to.

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:08.090
Many thoughts and feelings will clash.

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:12.000
And the way the match-ups will be decided is... a lottery!

00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:12.010
It's the system!
And the way the match-ups will be decided is... a lottery!

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:13.220
It's the system!

00:24:13.700 --> 00:24:17.330
Next time: <i>Heaven and Hell? The Eve of the Battle!</i>

00:24:17.330 --> 00:24:20.060
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
